{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-09-29 12:10:00', 'title': 'POTOMAC EDISON USING AERIAL SAW TO TRIM TREES IN RURAL AREAS', 'text': 'WORK INCLUDES TRIMMING ALONG MORE THAN 180 MILES OF HIGH-VOLTAGE POWER LINES IN MARYLAND, WEST VIRGINIA AND VIRGINIA WILLIAMSPORT, MD. , SEPT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POTOMAC EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS USING A HELICOPTER EQUIPPED WITH AN AERIAL SAW TO TRIM TREES AND MAINTAIN PROPER CLEARANCES ALONG 17 DIFFICULT-TO-ACCESS TRANSMISSION LINE CORRIDORS IN MARYLAND, WEST VIRGINIA AND VIRGINIA.'}